## claude-hud — bundled, unmodified

The status-line HUD itself (context bar, git status, tool/agent/todo lines, i18n,
configuration handling) is **not** ours. It is bundled verbatim in
[`vendor/claude-hud/`](vendor/claude-hud/) and driven through its public entry points
(`main({ readStdin, loadConfig })`); we do not patch it.

