### On the "cost + balance" segment layout

The layout of the money segment (a delta since the last refresh, the cumulative
session cost, the balance with the age of that reading, and the plugin version, all
on the first line) follows the convention that existing DeepSeek status-line monitors
use, so that switching to this project does not change what people are used to. The
numbers behind it are computed here from DeepSeek's official price list; no code from
those monitors is included.
